{
  "name": "15 · Bank Statement Reader (Kaamchor AI · MAP 2.0 · Finance)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 15 · Statement Reader\nBank statement PDF upload karo → AI har transaction ki draft entry banata hai (ledger suggest karta hai) → sheet mein. Kam confidence wali entries CHECK mark. **Accountant check karta hai, tab hi Tally mein jaata hai.**\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets: **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential, paste your sheet URL in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Draft entries**.\n2. AI model: **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n3. WhatsApp nodes: **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential + your **Phone Number ID** (replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID). Replace YOUR_CA_WHATSAPP.\n\nLong statements: split by month. Scanned PDFs need OCR first.",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "c3c25066-6f60-4c27-a9ec-44b9c0ba0a84",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -400,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Bank statement → draft entries",
        "formDescription": "Staff only. Upload a text PDF statement (not a scan). Entries come out as DRAFTS for your accountant to check – nothing is posted to Tally.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Client",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Statement",
              "fieldType": "file",
              "acceptFileTypes": ".pdf",
              "multipleFiles": false,
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "372afda6-5572-4ffa-9fbd-c7a0be071e3e",
      "name": "Upload statement",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "pdf",
        "binaryPropertyName": "Statement",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "caf46db7-46e8-4e11-9473-f7184361ff28",
      "name": "Read PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Bank statement text for client {{ $('Upload statement').item.json.Client }}:\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nFor EVERY transaction return: date (yyyy-mm-dd), narration, amount (number), type (Dr/Cr), a suggested ledger (e.g. Sales, Purchase, Rent, Salary, Bank Charges, GST Payment, Owner Drawings, Loan, Suspense), and confidence 0-1. Use Suspense with low confidence when unsure. Do not invent transactions; copy amounts exactly.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "f0dfea37-1198-4e28-945c-18f2d7a3e3f3",
      "name": "AI drafts entries",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.1
        }
      },
      "id": "846d23ed-e7d6-46c5-ab8b-8b2ecd552907",
      "name": "AI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        440,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"date\": \"2026-09-03\",\n      \"narration\": \"UPI/RAJ TRADERS/purchase\",\n      \"amount\": 18400,\n      \"type\": \"Dr\",\n      \"ledger\": \"Purchase\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.9\n    }\n  ]\n}"
      },
      "id": "a0d30fd1-9188-4a81-adb7-17c2ed5011f2",
      "name": "JSON shape",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        640,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const client = $('Upload statement').first().json.Client;\nconst E = $json.output.entries || [];\nconst rows = E.map(e => ({ json: { Client: client, Date: e.date, Narration: e.narration, Amount: e.amount, 'Dr/Cr': e.type,\n  Ledger: e.ledger, Confidence: e.confidence, Status: e.confidence < 0.7 ? 'CHECK' : 'Draft' } }));\nconst dr = E.filter(e => e.type === 'Dr').reduce((s, e) => s + Number(e.amount), 0);\nconst cr = E.filter(e => e.type === 'Cr').reduce((s, e) => s + Number(e.amount), 0);\nrows.forEach(r => Object.assign(r.json, { _total_dr: dr, _total_cr: cr, _count: E.length, _check: E.filter(e => e.confidence < 0.7).length }));\nreturn rows;"
      },
      "id": "cb96f88b-273e-434f-aab4-0ec3a03b7293",
      "name": "Rows + checks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        760,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
